From: jmills <josephjamesmills@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 15:44:36 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] cmake: fix relocatable include directory

Use CMAKE_INSTALL_INCLUDEDIR for exported targets.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 yoga/CMakeLists.txt | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/yoga/CMakeLists.txt b/yoga/CMakeLists.txt
index b6eca1ac..57d8666b 100644
--- a/yoga/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/yoga/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -38,4 +38,4 @@ endif()
 target_include_directories(yogacore
     PUBLIC
     $<BUILD_INTERFACE:${YOGA_ROOT}>
-    $<INSTALL_INTERFACE:${CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX}/include/yoga>)
+    $<INSTALL_INTERFACE:${CMAKE_INSTALL_INCLUDEDIR}>)
